# Source for requirements-kokoro.txt (asset-tooling#30). Regenerate with the command in docs/kokoro.md.
# torch comes from the PyTorch CPU wheel index as a direct, hash-locked URL, so the install needs no
# extra index and every other package resolves from PyPI. The lock targets CPython 3.12 on Linux x86_64.
